cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AI4OrgChem, please cite this software release and the associated manuscript."
title: "AI4OrgChem: an AI for Science agent for independent computational evidence assessment in organic chemistry"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chen
    given-names: Xiao
version: 0.1.0-rc3
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  AI4OrgChem is an AI for Science agent that independently reconstructs and
  evaluates fourteen counter-traditional propositions in organic structure
  theory using scope-bounded quantum-chemical evidence, public core software,
  equivariant learning, active sampling, symbolic testing, and traceable
  evidence presentation.
keywords:
  - AI for Science
  - computational chemistry
  - organic chemistry
  - localized fragment molecular orbitals
  - energy decomposition
  - reproducible research
